      "id": 247744,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-08-30T17:47:45.160Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Bald eagles are super derpy and sound like weenies. XD Any time you hear one in a movie, it’s been overdubbed with a hawk. They’re the <em>real</em> cool birds.</p>\n<p>inb4 all the Euros being shocked we have to pay to get our taxes done in the US :B</p>\n<p>The Glamsdale Glam-o-drome? :V</p>\n<p>Do I hear Glamour event for Definitive Miss Information? I could totally ship Glamfo. ;D</p>\n<p>Love how she gets out of the force field. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"> That’s classic.</p>\n<p>Absolute Zero, man of the people. Weird that he’s Proletariat’s nemesis. :V</p>\n<p>Ooh, it me! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>So what I am hearing is that the tattoo protected Christopher from worse damage. Also hearing that Waykeep is in fact the secret to bringing Scholar back. :V</p>\n<p>Okay but seriously, what did I miss? Do they mean Guise? Is it Guise? He’s not that smart though, c’mon.</p>\n<p>“I am so unhappy.” Love it. Great to see this bit reach its ultimate conclusion. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>",
