      "created_at": "2022-09-01T01:54:56.399Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Much as I don’t like the isolation and the lack of dimensional or time travel, I don’t think that’s going to happen at any point in the foreseeable future in the metaplot. If I had to guess, I would say that if it does happen, it’ll be something to do with the whole Prime War thing, if that ever happens. I had though that the RPG universe would eventually grow to become a new multiverse, but A&amp;C recently said that the sandwich bag wouldn’t stretch.</p>",
